{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30413","headline":"泊凫矶江馆 · 赵嘏","name":"泊凫矶江馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风雪晴来岁欲除，孤舟晚下意何如。\n月当轩色湖平後，雁断云声夜起初。\n傍晓管弦何处静，犯寒杨柳遶津疎。\n三间茅屋东溪上，归去生涯竹与书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30413.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30413","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}